If you're after fame and money...

525
00:30:54,570 --> 00:30:55,508
that is being selfish.

526
00:30:56,249 --> 00:30:58,703
When you refrain from being selfish,
that's Art!

527
00:30:59,383 --> 00:31:01,236
More than those who create it,

528
